WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.018 --> 00:00:02.527
Go to definition and View usages

2
00:00:02.527 --> 00:00:12.048
Right-click a sample reference in the note

3
00:00:12.048 --> 00:00:19.078
Go to definition opens the definition window

4
00:00:19.078 --> 00:00:25.009
In the Samples view, right-click → Show sample definition

5
00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:29.627
Shows where each description came from and its usages by experiment

6
00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:33.760
In the Samples view, right-click → View usages

7
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.096
Each use is listed with its section; pick one to open it there
